OL,3,GNEWSAAccolade status for university's
OL,4,AJapanese exhibits
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Japanese collections at a
OL,7,Funiversity's oriental museum have been
OL,8,Fawarded designated collection status by
OL,9,FArts Council England.
OL,11,FThe Durham University items span
OL,12,Fcenturies of Japanese history and
OL,13,Fculture, from the Muromachi period
OL,14,Fthrough to contemporary works.
OL,16,FRachel Barclay, the museum's senior
OL,17,Fcurator, said the accolade was "a
OL,18,Fwonderful recognition".
